WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
The phone rings out.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
You're under a dash.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
You can't pick up.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
They call the next shop.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Voicemail. Lockout callers don't leave messages.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Answering services fumble the job details, or feel like a call center.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.000
You finish the job in front of you.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:50.000
The next one is waiting, with the name, location, job type, and urgency.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Plain reports. You can check our work.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:00.000
Call the demo line: 206-743-6296. Hear what your callers would hear. The smart first move.
